    "message": "Yes. To narrow down good Chicago apartment options, tell me: 1) monthly budget, 2) preferred neighborhoods or commute destination, 3) move-in date, 4) studio/1BR/2BR, 5) must-haves like in-unit laundry, parking, pet-friendly, elevator, or gym, and 6) whether you care more about price, safety, nightlife, transit, or quiet.",
    "timestamp": 1778245712.232
  }
}

{
  "available": true,
  "message": "Move-in would be **July 1, 2026**. My max rent is **$2,400/month** (excluding any one-time move-in fees). I\u2019m mainly looking in **Lakeview, Lincoln Park, Wicker Park, or Logan Square**.",
  "event": {
    "id": 3,
