    "message": "Move-in would be **July 1, 2026**. My max rent is **$2,400/month** (excluding any one-time move-in fees). I\u2019m mainly looking in **Lakeview, Lincoln Park, Wicker Park, or Logan Square**.",
    "timestamp": 1778245716.936
  }
}

{
  "ok": true,
  "event": {
    "id": 4,
    "role": "agent",
    "turn": 4,
    "message": "Those neighborhoods fit your budget, but the tradeoffs differ. At up to $2,400/month for a July 1 move, you can usually target: 1BRs in Lakeview and Logan Square comfortably, some 1BRs in Wicker Park, and more limited or smaller options in Lincoln Park. To narrow this well, I still need: 1) unit size: studio or 1BR, 2) commute destination or CTA line preference, 3) must-haves like in-unit laundry, central AC, dishwasher, parking, elevator, pet-friendly, outdoor space, and 4) whether you want quieter/residential or more nightlife/walkability.",
    "timestamp": 1778245724.737
  }
}

{
  "available": true,
  "message": "I\u2019m looking for a **1 bedroom or larger**. I have **one 45 lb dog**, and a **hard requirement is in-unit laundry** (building laundry isn\u2019t enough). I also have a strong preference to **avoid garden/basement units** if possible.",
  "event": {
    "id": 5,
    "role": "simulated_user",
