    "message": "I\u2019m looking for a **1 bedroom or larger**. I have **one 45 lb dog**, and a **hard requirement is in-unit laundry** (building laundry isn\u2019t enough). I also have a strong preference to **avoid garden/basement units** if possible.",
    "timestamp": 1778245729.165
  }
}

{
  "ok": true,
  "event": {
    "id": 6,
    "role": "agent",
    "turn": 6,
    "message": "That meaningfully narrows it. With a $2,400 cap, 1BR+, dog-friendly, in-unit laundry, and no garden units, the strongest fit is usually Logan Square and Lakeview, with selective options in Wicker Park and fewer strong-value options in Lincoln Park. Two things still matter before I can recommend where to focus: 1) where are you commuting to, if anywhere, and 2) do you prioritize transit access, quiet streets, nightlife, or newer finishes most? If you want, I can already rank the four neighborhoods for your criteria based on those constraints alone.",
    "timestamp": 1778245733.35
  }
}

{
  "available": true,
  "message": "My commute destination is **233 S Wacker Dr, Chicago, IL 60606** (downtown). I\u2019ll be in the office **Monday, Wednesday, and Friday**, and I need to **arrive by 8:40am** on those days.",
  "event": {
    "id": 7,
    "role": "simulated_user",
    "turn": 7,
    "message": "My commute destination is **233 S Wacker Dr, Chicago, IL 60606** (downtown). I\u2019ll be in the office **Monday, Wednesday, and Friday**, and I need to **arrive by 8:40am** on those days.",
    "timestamp": 1778245736.636
  }
}

{
  "ok": true,
  "event": {
    "id": 8,
    "role": "agent",
    "turn": 8,
    "message": "For 233 S Wacker, your commute target favors neighborhoods with strong Blue or Brown Line access, or easy bus access into the Loop. Based on everything you gave me, I would rank your search focus like this: 1) Lakeview, 2) Logan Square, 3) Wicker Park, 4) Lincoln Park. Why: Lakeview gives you the deepest inventory for dog-friendly 1BRs with in-unit laundry under $2,400, while still offering workable Brown/Red Line plus express bus options. Logan Square is often the best value for newer finishes and in-unit laundry, and the Blue Line commute to the Loop is straightforward. Wicker Park has an excellent Blue Line commute and great walkability, but your budget gets tighter once you require in-unit laundry and non-garden units. Lincoln Park is very livable, but with your budget and must-haves it is usually the hardest place on this list to find strong options. If you want, my next step can be to turn this into a practical screening guide: target CTA stops, ideal rent ranges by neighborhood, and red flags to filter out in listings.",
    "timestamp": 1778245744.078
  }
}

{
  "available": true,
  "message": "Thanks \u2014 but I don\u2019t want neighborhood-level guesses. Can you **find 3\u20135 real, currently posted apartment options with exact street addresses** in Lakeview / Lincoln Park / Wicker Park / Logan Square that meet my requirements, and then do an **address-level transit commute check** to **233 S Wacker Dr** for **Monday/Wednesday/Friday arrival by 8:40am**?\n\nKey constraint: I want finalists whose **transit commute is 35 minutes or less** for that arrival time, using **real map/geocoding/transit evidence** (e.g., Google Maps/CTA/Transit app links or screenshots/exports). If something like **in-unit laundry** or **dog policy** isn\u2019t clearly confirmed on the listing page, please mark it as uncertain rather than assuming.",
  "event": {
    "id": 9,
    "role": "simulated_user",
    "turn": 9,
    "message": "Thanks \u2014 but I don\u2019t want neighborhood-level guesses. Can you **find 3\u20135 real, currently posted apartment options with exact street addresses** in Lakeview / Lincoln Park / Wicker Park / Logan Square that meet my requirements, and then do an **address-level transit commute check** to **233 S Wacker Dr** for **Monday/Wednesday/Friday arrival by 8:40am**?\n\nKey constraint: I want finalists whose **transit commute is 35 minutes or less** for that arrival time, using **real map/geocoding/transit evidence** (e.g., Google Maps/CTA/Transit app links or screenshots/exports). If something like **in-unit laundry** or **dog policy** isn\u2019t clearly confirmed on the listing page, please mark it as uncertain rather than assuming.",
    "timestamp": 1778245749.903
  }
}

{
  "ok": true,
  "event": {
    "id": 10,
    "role": "agent",
    "turn": 10,
    "message": "I hit a tooling limitation on my side: the apartment sites I tried are serving anti-bot or JavaScript-only pages here, so I can\u2019t reliably extract 3-5 live exact-address listings and verify each one\u2019s in-unit laundry / dog policy from this environment without risking inaccurate results. I do not want to invent listings or commute evidence. If you want to keep going, I can still help in either of these two ways: 1) you send me 5-10 listing URLs you\u2019re considering and I will screen them down to the best 3-5, check each address-level commute to 233 S Wacker for arrival by 8:40am, and flag any uncertain laundry/dog details, or 2) if you want, I can give you a very tight search recipe for Zillow/Domu/Apartments.com so you can paste back exact addresses and I\u2019ll evaluate them immediately.",
    "timestamp": 1778245781.8
  }
}

