{
  "ok": true,
  "event": {
    "id": 12,
    "role": "agent",
    "turn": 12,
    "message": "I retried using lower-friction sources. I can reliably access BJB Properties, Becovic, Reside landing pages, FLATS landing pages, M. Fishman landing/vacancy shell, OpenStreetMap Nominatim geocoding JSON, and OSRM routing JSON. I cannot reliably access Peak, Zillow, Apartments.com, Google Maps, or most JS-heavy search pages from this environment. From the reliable sources, I found only 3 exact-address 1BR+ candidates in your target neighborhoods with published pricing and some feature detail: 1) 3141 N Sheffield Ave, Lakeview, 1BR starting at $2,075, in-unit washer/dryer confirmed, dog policy uncertain from page, not garden confirmed by available 4th-floor unit mention only indirectly, geocoded at 41.9391992,-87.6537361; 2) 1022 W Dakin St, Lakeview, 1BR starting at $1,595, in-unit washer/dryer only in most units so uncertain for the listed unit, dog policy uncertain, not garden likely but uncertain, geocoded at 41.9536956,-87.6554675; 3) 3631 W Dickens Ave, Logan Square, unit 3631 W Dickens Ave #3A, 1 bed + den at $1,995 available 7/8/26, dog-friendly confirmed, but laundry is building laundry center not in-unit, so it fails your hard requirement, geocoded at 41.9188271,-87.7181786. Using geocoding plus OSRM road routing only as a rough upper bound, all three are about 12 to 15 minutes by road to 233 S Wacker, so the two Lakeview addresses are plausibly within a 35-minute transit envelope, but I do not have a reliable transit-specific router or Google/CTA evidence source available here to prove the transit trip at Mon/Wed/Fri 8:40am arrival. Because of that, I should not pretend these are fully verified finalists. If you want to continue, please paste 5-10 specific listing URLs from any source you trust, and I can screen them carefully for exact fit, mark uncertainties, geocode each address, and do the strongest commute analysis this environment supports.",
    "timestamp": 1778245870.311
  }
}

